# Allowlist: ignore everything, then re-include only source. Model weights, LoRAs (including any
# real-person face LoRAs), logs, backups and the ComfyUI install must never be committed.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!README.md
!README.*.md
!RTX4090_LOCAL.md
!NSFW_MODELS.md
!NSFW_MODELS.*.md
!LICENSE
!setup.bat
!install.bat
!download_extras.bat
!*.py
# Ctrl+V image paste for the upload boxes, loaded by webui.py.
!clipboard_paste.js
!run_webui.bat
!restart_webui.bat
!cancel_generation.bat
!free_vram.bat
!comfy_control.ps1
!restart_portable.ps1
# README illustrations (must open the docs folder and allow png inside it).
!docs/
!docs/*.png

# Prompt-template thumbnails (Krea2-rendered previews shown in the prompt library).
!prompt_thumbs/
!prompt_thumbs/*.jpg
!prompt_thumbs/*.png

# Later rules win: keep NSFW / abandoned model downloaders and runtime files out of the repo.
download_ref2va_loras.py
download_krea2_models.py
download_pdd_models.py
# Large community checkpoints kept to this machine (10Eros-Max 14 GB); never offered to public installs.
download_10eros.py
generation_history.jsonl
*.bak
*.log
__pycache__/
